          "old": "In a real deployment, inspect the index's source link and deployed generator revision, sync the intended Demerzel SHA into Learn, deploy, then repeat anonymous readback.",
          "new": "For the historical pipeline, inspect the index source and generator revision before deploying the intended Demerzel copy. For current Learn, inspect the deployed Learn revision, initial-copy and supplemental provenance, and rendered lesson against the reviewed source, then repeat anonymous readback.",
          "reason": "Update the actionable deployment diagnosis after source migration."
        },
        {
          "old": "then sync and deploy that reviewed SHA through Learn and run anonymous readback against the module and index.",
          "new": "then generate and deploy the reviewed Learn revision and run a current anonymous readback against the lesson, index and expected rendered content.",
          "reason": "Update the learner task answer to the current authoring location."
